      "observed": "An extra 74LVC1G86 XOR gate (U8) is present. Its input pin 2 is on Net-(U8-Pad2), which also connects U6.21 (TMC2209 OA2 motor phase output) and H8.2 (stepper connector). Its output pin 4 is on Net-(U8-Pad4), which connects to U6.9 (MS1/AD0 configuration input). Its input pin 1 is on Net-(U8-Pad1), which connects to U7.20 (STDBY input).",
      "expected": "U8 is not in the design specification. The TMC2209 motor phase output U6.21 should connect only to H8.2. MS1/AD0 and STDBY should be tied to fixed logic levels or left unconnected per the TMC2209 datasheet, not driven by an XOR gate that senses a motor phase.",
