          "quote": "(net (code \"119\") (name \"Net-(U8-Pad2)\") (class \"Default\")\n      (node (ref \"H8\") (pin \"2\") (pintype \"passive\"))\n      (node (ref \"U6\") (pin \"21\") (pinfunction \"OA2\") (pintype \"output\"))\n      (node (ref \"U8\") (pin \"2\") (pintype \"input\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"120\") (name \"Net-(U8-Pad4)\") (class \"Default\")\n      (node (ref \"U6\") (pin \"9\") (pinfunction \"MS1/AD0\") (pintype \"input\"))\n      (node (ref \"U8\") (pin \"4\") (pintype \"output\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"118\") (name \"Net-(U8-Pad1)\") (class \"Default\")\n      (node (ref \"U7\") (pin \"20\") (pinfunction \"STDBY\") (pintype \"input\"))\n      (node (ref \"U8\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"input\")))"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "U5, U6, U7 — TMC2209 ... each drives a 2-phase coil output (`/A_xx+/-`, `/B_xx+/-`) to connectors H7/H8/H9"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The XOR gate input U8.2 is tied to a 24V motor phase, exceeding the 74LVC1G86's absolute maximum input voltage and likely damaging U8. The XOR output drives U6 MS1/AD0, causing the microstep resolution/UART address to depend on motor phase and U7 STDBY, leading to unpredictable motor operation. U7 STDBY is left floating.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design files contain an extra 74LVC1G86 XOR gate (U8) that bridges a TMC2209 motor phase output to logic inputs and configuration pins, which is not in the specification and will likely damage the gate and cause erratic motor behavior."
}

